(In any case, it escapes me why net.sources should exist ONLY for
nerdware collectors, and why EVERYBODY ELSE should just get OFF!!)

Then, we can DELETE net.wanted.sources, and let everybody post their
wants to net.sources along with the source-posters, and the comment-posters,
and commentators, etc...  This, of course, would make it incumbent upon
people posting sources to post them to TWO newsgroups, which would
probably be cause for Did-I-Miss-Something paranoia among the nerdware
collectors, but there's probably a better chance that whoever is trying
to give something away will post it all over the place, than there is
that they will read net.wanted.sources over and over looking for someone
to give it to.

